      "abstractNote": "This repository provides the code and documentation for a dictionary-based Named Entity Recognition (NER) approach aimed at generating TF-IDF vectors. It utilizes the Whatizit annotation tool to annotate input XML files against a controlled vocabulary, specifically the Medical Subject Headings (MeSH) ontology. The approach allows for the efficient extraction and representation of named entities in documents, facilitating document analysis and similarity assessments within the RELISH Corpus.",
